[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRISIS_FRIEND]
Friend of Crisis

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRISIS_FRIEND_desc]
Now King Sombra has finally joined the ranks of the Crisis, the rule of the Emperor of Shadows will be immortal forever. The Windigos will have the sky, while the shadows will rule the vast land of Equestria.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRISIS_FRIEND]
灾厄之友

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRISIS_FRIEND_desc]
如今，森布拉大王终于跻身与天灾之列，暗影之皇帝的统治将永世不朽。风之魔将拥有天空，而暗影将统治小马利亚的广袤大地。

